  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Yes-or-no questions",
     "texto": [
      "To report a yes-or-no question, use **spurgte om** (asked if) + subordinate word order: **Hun spurgte, om jeg havde tid.** = She asked if I had time.",
      "There's no inversion: don't put the verb before the subject, as in a direct question («Har du tid?»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Questions with a question word",
     "texto": [
      "With **hvor** (where), **hvornår** (when) or **hvad** (what), the same rule: **Han spurgte, hvor jeg boede.** = He asked where I lived.",
      "The verb changes tense just as in reported speech: «bor» → «boede»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Direct question",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Reported question",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
